WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.050
Step three parses a string that
uses the deprecated password mode.

2
00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:06.962
It parses as entra, because
it is an Entra mode.

3
00:00:06.962 --> 00:00:09.088
But the mode is the deprecated one,

4
00:00:09.088 --> 00:00:12.275
so the scan reports it as a
finding, and never as done.

5
00:00:12.275 --> 00:00:14.581
A careless scan would count it as done,

6
00:00:14.581 --> 00:00:18.450
and a deprecated flow that can't
do M F A would stay in production.

7
00:00:18.450 --> 00:00:23.213
The kit's driver configuration lists the
deprecated modes, and the finding names it.

8
00:00:23.213 --> 00:00:27.050
And notice the password: even
here, it comes back masked.
